{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31307","headline":"欧阳示新诗因贻四韵 · 刘威","name":"欧阳示新诗因贻四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冲戛瑶琼得至音，数篇清越应南金。\n都由苦思无休日，已证前贤不到心。\n风入寒松声自古，水归沧海意皆深。\n欲知字字惊神鬼，一气秋时试夜吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘威","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31307.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31307","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}